@startuml gesture-states
!include visio2003.iuml

title DialController - Gesture Recognition

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Idle : rotated(n) /\nunmute if muted,\nstep volume by n x step
Idle --> PressedStill : pressed

PressedStill --> Idle : released /\ntoggle mute, haptic confirm
PressedStill --> PressedTurned : rotated(n) /\nunmute if muted,\nstep volume by n x step / 4

PressedTurned --> PressedTurned : rotated(n) /\nstep volume by n x step / 4
PressedTurned --> Idle : released /\nno mute toggle

PressedStill --> Idle : dial disconnected
PressedTurned --> Idle : dial disconnected

@enduml
